{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nWe spent the night in Flamen Hoofd. The road here is paved like the Kings Road in Berlin, lined with trees, and stretches between fields, gardens, and meadows. In contrast to Aachen and Liège, we saw not a single beggar here. The village children wear shoes, many of them wooden, and stockings. We drove through a village of 15,000 inhabitants. It is a pleasant change from what we were accustomed to in the eastern provinces. The order here is visible and calm. I am drinking a good wine and writing you these few lines to tell you about our journey. Karl and Immanuel will surely be curious, but I hope they will learn more from this order than from mere storytelling. The freedom that I recognize in the German spirit manifests itself here in the quiet of everyday life, not in the noise. I think of you in Berlin, where life has its own rhythm. Until soon, I kiss you.\n\nYour G.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221111,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":210,"prompt_tokens":317,"total_tokens":527,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-dudV5mQzIUgHx0O0IiSQIytOBKG9tDWx","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":317,"prompt_ms":422.31,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3322082018927446,"prompt_per_second":750.6334209466979,"predicted_n":210,"predicted_ms":4858.571,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.246751196172248,"predicted_per_second":43.01676357101707}}